[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2528257782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100116#issuecomment-2528257782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100116","id":2528257782,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wsib2","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T15:02:38Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T15:57:54Z","body":"Possibly unrelated to the changes of this PR, there is memory leaking in the editor during the time that it can't use/initialize an audio device:\r\n\r\n![mem_issue](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/692e8760-e6a9-4208-9973-34bcb268e9a2)\r\n\r\nI haven't compared with \"before this PR\", because without this fix there are tens of thousands of error messages logged to the console, so \"before this PR\" is obviously going to be messy in terms of memory anyway.\r\n\r\nI'm converting this PR to be a draft while I look into why memory is increasing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2528257782/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529398849","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100116#issuecomment-2529398849","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100116","id":2529398849,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ww5BB","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T20:39:25Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T20:39:25Z","body":"Well, I've found a bunch of memory leaks and fixed them up, but still haven't got things entirely stable. Here's where I'm at with my profiler:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2cc31a7-d09a-4ea2-abf5-d773d7ccb959)\r\n\r\nNow I'm only getting around 100 allocations every ten seconds instead of something like 1,500. This is a lot better than how things were before, but it appears that things could be better...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529398849/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532183935","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100116#issuecomment-2532183935","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100116","id":2532183935,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W7g9_","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T16:15:11Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T16:15:11Z","body":"Alright, it turns out that the `CMMNotificationClient` was never being unregistered. I've pushed changes that fix this issue.\r\n\r\nThis seems to remove any remaining memory leaks that happen from attempting (and failing) to reinitialize an audio device literally thousands of times per second:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f56772ff-637b-48fe-80af-ebe98d0b5852)\r\n\r\nThere are still some allocation increases and decreases that can be seen in those snapshots, but I don't believe these are leaks related to WASAPI. The initial large allocation is likely from the console error messages in the editor.\r\n\r\nThe next bit of work is to make the re-initialization attempts a little bit more reasonable. These should not be called thousands of times per second. Maybe once every second or so would be a better approach?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532183935/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532288608","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100116#issuecomment-2532288608","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100116","id":2532288608,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W76hg","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T16:58:21Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T16:58:21Z","body":"I've updated the PR to only attempt to reinitialize audio devices once every 1 second or so instead of once every millisecond.\r\n\r\nAt this point, I think this PR addresses the outstanding major issues of error spam, memory leaks, and pathologically attempting to re-initialize an unavailable audio device every millisecond. This can probably be safely cherry-picked, but I'll leave that to the production team to assess.\r\n\r\nIf anyone wants to test the scenario where the audio device is lost due to being taken over by an exclusive mode device, you can use [foobar2000](https://www.foobar2000.org/) and switch to \"Primary Sound Driver [exclusive]\" while the Godot editor is open. Switch back to the default \"Primary Sound Driver\" to successfully re-initialize the WASAPI audio device.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/da534346-c5ed-457b-989f-3d47cb9b843d)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532288608/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2589948101","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100116#issuecomment-2589948101","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100116","id":2589948101,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aX3jF","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T13:44:29Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T13:44:29Z","body":"Cross-posting here that someone was able to test this PR and confirm it fixes the issue it intends to fix: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/18732#issuecomment-2589768890","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2589948101/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590655145","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100116#issuecomment-2590655145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100116","id":2590655145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aakKp","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T17:33:26Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T17:33:26Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590655145/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]